  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, triangle is\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0016_3d67d4dfe723.png\">\r\n\r\n$\\theta=\\cos ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{|\\mathbf{C}|}{|\\mathbf{A}|}\\right)$\r\n$\\theta=\\cos ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)$"
